{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dirtzone</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911960/extras/c80cc6cfd46f533336f2b92837e625cb.avif?t=1755028114\" width=500 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the thrill of true off-road adventure.  <br>Drive through challenging terrain, from muddy trails to rocky hills. Customize your vehicle, unlock new upgrades, and master each environment with precision and skill. Whether you're a casual explorer or a hardcore off-road enthusiast, this game delivers an immersive and adrenaline-pumping journey into the wild.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3911960?t=1755028114","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911960/f705152a5f83df06e9d70d394baa94d97142f8ef/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755028114","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911960/88679d8c73d567b455fd349dee41498c62125fe1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755028114","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911960/88679d8c73d567b455fd349dee41498c62125fe1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755028114","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dirtzone</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911960/extras/c80cc6cfd46f533336f2b92837e625cb.avif?t=1755028114\" width=500 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the thrill of true off-road adventure.  <br>Drive through challenging terrain, from muddy trails to rocky hills. Customize your vehicle, unlock new upgrades, and master each environment with precis